{"page":{"id":"a918f6e6-d8a1-4f1e-bb2c-f8da367f20b9","theme":"destiny","slug":"/destiny/traveler/the-city","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/destiny/traveler/the-city","title":"The Last City","meta_title":"The Last City (Destiny) — place, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"The Last City is humanity's great refuge under the Traveler, protected by Guardians from the Tower's walls. Related pages: The Traveler, The Tower, Cabal,…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Humanity&#039;s refuge beneath the Traveler.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/destiny/traveler\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Traveler</strong></a>, <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city/tower\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Tower</strong></a>, <a href=\"/destiny/cabal\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Cabal</strong></a>, <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Destiny</strong></a>, <a href=\"/destiny/destiny-1\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Destiny (2014)</strong></a> and <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Guardians</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How The Last City connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Located In:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/traveler\" class=\"entity-link\">The Traveler</a>\n            — The Last City shelters beneath the Traveler.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city/tower\" class=\"entity-link\">The Tower</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city/tower\" class=\"entity-link\">The Tower</a> overlooks the Last City.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Opposes:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/cabal\" class=\"entity-link\">Cabal</a>\n            — The <a href=\"/destiny/cabal\" class=\"entity-link\">Cabal</a> assaulted the Last City.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny</a> is connected to The Last City through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/destiny-1\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny (2014)</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny/destiny-1\" class=\"entity-link\">Destiny (2014)</a> is connected to The Last City through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\">Guardians</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\">Guardians</a> is connected to The Last City through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard\" class=\"entity-link\">The Vanguard</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard\" class=\"entity-link\">The Vanguard</a> is connected to The Last City through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard/zavala\" class=\"entity-link\">Commander Zavala</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard/zavala\" class=\"entity-link\">Commander Zavala</a> is connected to The Last City through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<s